  "releaseNotes": "v5.8.37 - Video pipelines (Wan, LTX, LTX-2) report \"loading the text encoder / transformer / VAE\" while a file opens (an open of a hub file waits for its whole download; the /video page said \"encoding the prompt\" through a 6.4 GB download). Reopening a cached browser model file costs about half (OpfsModelCache: one part listing, parts fetched at once, no sidecar rewrite for a repeat use; a 48-part entry 55 to 29 ms), and the umT5 encoder opens its file 2 times per prompt instead of 26.",
